---
description: Swift 6 concurrency conventions
globs: Sunnies/**/*.swift, SunniesTests/**/*.swift
---
- Swift 6 language mode; app and unit-test targets default to MainActor.
- Mark Domain and Data types, protocols, and services `nonisolated`. Use `actor` for mutable shared state.
- UI state lives in `@Observable @MainActor` view models.
- No unbounded `Task` creation; tie tasks to view lifetime (`.task`) or store and cancel them.
- No `try!`, no force unwraps unless provably safe. Image work off the main actor.
